      ],
      "flexcontaineritem_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
       "text_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "text": "<p>SiTime is transforming the world of electronics with MEMS-based precision timing solutions that are more robust, programmable, and reliable than traditional quartz devices. With over 3 billion units shipped, SiTime is the global leader in silicon precision timing solutions, helping designers build smaller, more accurate, and more resilient systems, across every industry.</p>\n<p>Macnica Americas is proud to distribute SiTime products including a full portfolio of oscillators, TCXOs, OCXOs, jitter cleaners, and network synchronizers, along with engineering support to accelerate your next design.</p>",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
        "textIsRich": "true"
       }
      },
      "flexcontaineritem_2": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
